## 🎯 Mission
To democratize AI training by providing **open, verifiable, and ethically sourced datasets** through the **Commons Vector Protocol (CVP)**. All data is:
✅ **Cryptographically signed** (Ed25519)
✅ **Content-addressed** (IPFS CIDs)
✅ **Provenance-tracked** (CVP Instruments)
✅ **Ollama-compatible** (JSONL for fine-tuning)

