## 🚀 Quick Start

### 1. Install Dependencies
```bash
# Clone repo
git clone https://github.com/neuralcommons/neuralcommons
cd neuralcommons

# Python environment
python -m venv venv
source venv/bin/activate  # Linux/Mac
venv\Scripts\activate     # Windows
pip install -r requirements.txt

# Install Ollama (https://ollama.com)
curl -fsSL https://ollama.com/install.sh | sh  # Linux/Mac
iwr -useb https://ollama.com/install.ps1 | iex  # Windows
ollama pull mistral
```

### 2. Prepare Training Data
```bash
# Download and preprocess Wikipedia data
python src/cli/preprocess.py

# Deduplicate
python src/cli/dedupe.py

# Create CVP Instrument
python src/cli/create_dataset.py \
  --input data/processed/wikipedia_deduped.json \
  --name "Wikipedia Cleaned Dataset v1" \
  --output_dir instruments
```

### 3. Convert to Ollama Format
```bash
python src/cli/convert_to_ollama.py \
  --input instruments/20261101120000.car.json \
  --output data/ollama/train_data.jsonl
```

### 4. Fine-Tune with Ollama
```bash
# Windows (PowerShell)
.\scripts\fine-tune.ps1

# Linux/Mac
bash scripts/fine-tune.sh
```

### 5. Run Your Model
```bash
ollama run neuralcommons-mistral
```

